---
title: "ARCHITECTURE: runtime model"
---
block-beta
    accDescr: With **Public Network** on, other devices can connect to port 41532 (the default), if your network and firewall allow it. **HTTPS** encrypts everything sent over the network, including passwords and media.<br>Browsers never connect to **Eagle** or the library folder directly: the preview server reads the files and asks Eagle to save edits.
    columns 3

    block:clients["OTHER DEVICES"]
        columns 1
        browser("BROWSER VIEWER ── Media Library<br>Holds the session cookie (HttpOnly)<br>✓ Reaches the preview server only<br>✕ Eagle API, library folder")
        sw("SERVICE WORKER<br>Caches the app shell only<br>✕ Media files, API responses")
    end
    block:host["HOST MACHINE (runs Eagle)"]
        columns 1
        window("PLUGIN WINDOW ── settings UI<br>On / off, URL, QR code<br>Password, Public Network, HTTPS<br>Users and shared libraries<br>*Locked while the server runs*")
        service("BACKGROUND SERVICE ── no UI<br>Runs the preview server<br>Loads and saves settings<br>Relays library switches")
        server["MEDIA PREVIEW SERVER<br>**Listens on**<br>127.0.0.1:41532 (default)<br>0.0.0.0:41532 (Public Network)<br>**Access control**<br>✓ Origin check for writes<br>✓ Session cookie (Password protection)<br>✓ Roles: Viewer, Editor, Editor + Upload, Admin<br>✓ Shared libraries only<br>**File access**<br>✓ Media files are read only<br>✓ Edits and uploads go through Eagle's API<br>✓ Viewers get item ids, never paths"]
        eagle("EAGLE APP<br>Opens one library at a time<br>Writes rating, tags, folders, trash<br>Imports uploads<br>*API: http://localhost:41595*")
    end
    block:storage["STORAGE"]
        columns 1
        settings[("SETTINGS FILE<br>~/.eagle-media-preview-server/settings.json<br>✓ Owner-only access (700/600)<br>Users, password hashes<br>Port, hostname, HTTPS, shared libraries")]
        space
        other[("EAGLE LIBRARY ── not open<br>Work.library<br>✕ Not served until opened in Eagle")]
        library[("EAGLE LIBRARY ── open in Eagle<br>Photos.library/images/ID.info/<br>Original, thumbnail, metadata.json<br>Internal disk, external drive or NAS<br>✓ Only shared libraries are served<br>✓ ../ path escapes are rejected")]
    end

    browser <-->|"HTTPS :41532"| server
    browser -->|registers| sw
    window <-->|"control, status"| service
    service <-->|"read, write"| settings
    service -->|"start, stop"| server
    server <-->|"/api/v2/*"| eagle
    eagle <-->|"read, write"| library
    server -->|"reads files (HTTP Range)"| library

    classDef frame stroke:#aeb7c6
